    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 After paragraph 15Y(1)(cba)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024#sch-1-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(cbb) an offence against Part IIIA of this Act as in force at any time\nbefore the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Crimes\nLegislation Amendment (Sexual Offences Against Children)\nAct 2010;\n(cbc) an offence against any of the following arising under\nsection 6 of the Crimes at Sea Act 2000:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCrimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to\nSexual Violence) Act 2024\nNo. 114, 2024\n(cbd) an offence against section 14 or 15 of the Crimes (Aviation)\nAct 1991 arising under any of the following:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n(cbb) an offence against Part IIIA of this Act as in force at any time\nbefore the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Crimes\nLegislation Amendment (Sexual Offences Against Children)\nAct 2010;\n(cbc) an offence against any of the following arising under\nsection 6 of the Crimes at Sea Act 2000:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCrimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to\nSexual Violence) Act 2024\nNo. 114, 2024\n(cbd) an offence against section 14 or 15 of the Crimes (Aviation)\nAct 1991 arising under any of the following:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "02469967465ef0c2d3b04432f62ecdc2ea309409cd9cab211e5c71330696d2c0",
      "skos:note": "Inserts offences against certain Acts into this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024#sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 After paragraph 15Y(1)(cba)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(cbb) an offence against Part IIIA of this Act as in force at any time\nbefore the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Crimes\nLegislation Amendment (Sexual Offences Against Children)\nAct 2010;\n(cbc) an offence against any of the following arising under\nsection 6 of the Crimes at Sea Act 2000:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nCrimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to\nSexual Violence) Act 2024\nNo. 114, 2024\n(cbd) an offence against section 14 or 15 of the Crimes (Aviation)\nAct 1991 arising under any of the following:\n(i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);\n(ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900\n(ACT);\n(iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act\n1900 (ACT);\n(iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);"
    },
