      "cml:integrityHash": "a4e01957ce131cd16e14ff28003ea912eca519bfeb5df01a000938dfef37a846",
      "skos:note": "A person who is 18 or over can opt out of being treated as a child complainant. A person over 18 can opt out of being treated as a child witness."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024#sch-1-sec-17a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17A(2) After section 15YAB",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, a person who is 18 or over is not a child complainant if\nthe person informs the court that the person does not wish to be\ntreated as such a complainant.\n15YAD  Child witnesses"
    },
