    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26(2) After section 15YC",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024#sch-1-sec-26-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The court must not give leave unless the court is satisfied that:\n(a) the evidence is substantially relevant to facts in issue in the\nproceeding; and\n(b) the evidence has substantial probative value; and\n(c) either:\n(i) the evidence is of sexual activity that is alleged to form\npart of a connected set of circumstances in which the\nalleged offence was committed; or\n(ii) if the evidence is of sexual activities with a defendant in\nthe proceeding—the evidence relates to sexual activity\nthat occurred or was recent at the time of the\ncommission of the alleged offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The court must not give leave unless the court is satisfied that:\n(a) the evidence is substantially relevant to facts in issue in the\nproceeding; and\n(b) the evidence has substantial probative value; and\n(c) either:\n(i) the evidence is of sexual activity that is alleged to form\npart of a connected set of circumstances in which the\nalleged offence was committed; or\n(ii) if the evidence is of sexual activities with a defendant in\nthe proceeding—the evidence relates to sexual activity\nthat occurred or was recent at the time of the\ncommission of the alleged offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-26"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
