      "cof:title": "27A(1) After section 15YF",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A defendant in a vulnerable adult proceeding who is not\nrepresented by counsel is not to cross-examine a vulnerable adult\ncomplainant.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 114, 2024\nCrimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to\nSexual Violence) Act 2024\nNote:\nA person is not to cross-examine certain persons at committal\nproceedings or proceedings of a similar kind—see section 15YHA."
