      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury.",
      "cml:asserts": [
