      "cof:title": "30 At the end of section 15YK",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury."
    },
