      "values:originalText": "Despite the amendments made by this Schedule, Part IAD of the Crimes\nAct 1914, as in force immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule, continues to apply in relation to a proceeding begun, but not\ncompleted, before that commencement.\n\nCrimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to\nSexual Violence) Act 2024\nNo. 114, 2024\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 7 February 2024\nSenate on 26 February 2024]\n(3/24)",
